    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.Utk1OQRwYkMkFRD3]{mage hand} cantrip. When you reach 3rd level, you can cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ghXTfe7sgCbgf1Q8]{detect magic} spell once per day. When you reach 5th level, you can also cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.UDUnlfPsOAbq2RSE]{blur} spell once per day. Intelligence is your spellcasting ability for these spells.</p>",
